，更被拍到同遊巴黎。可是兩人的戀情短短三個月就結束，分開最大原因就是李智雅被爆與另一韓流天王徐太志已婚。（劇照）</figcaption></figure><p>芮塔／宋慧喬主演「黑暗榮耀」　揭韓國校園霸凌、階級制度不公真相</p><p>雀雀／檢察官的「壞媽媽」與好媽媽「車貞淑醫生」</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:02.760348+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3243,"images":54,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:50:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:22.756831+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:57:21.248647+00:00","content_hash":"8b665244650f137a3aa2e1eb57835a9872edd802d14ef2c80e9c4741394d2f3e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}